"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING.Hyperlink} на {DECAYING_EFFECT_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} [turn/][hyperlink,GLOBAL.TurnConcept]ходи[/"
"hyperlink]."

