"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED.Hyperlink} або {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist][br/]"
"{LOC.INTERFACE@ENCHANTMENT_NON_REPEATING@INSERT}"

msgid "HERO_SKILL@ROOTS@MODIFIER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"+{POISON_WEAPONS_DAMAGE_MULTIPLIER>ResolvedMultiplier}% шкоди проти цілей зі статусом {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED.Hyperlink} чи "
