"[hyperlink,GLOBAL.TurnConcept]ходи[/hyperlink]."

msgid "SHAREDMODIFIERS_UNITPROPERTIES@STATUS_VULNERABILITY@MODIFIER_DESCRIPTION_GUARANTEED"
msgstr ""
"Спричиняє {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STATUS_VULNERABILITY.Hyperlink} на {STATUS_VULNERABILITY_DESCRIPTION>NumTurns} "
"[hyperlink,GLOBAL.TurnConcept]ходи[/hyperlink]."

